@startuml
title WTC Workhub AWS target design — not deployed
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor "Student / Supervisor / Admin" as user
component "React / TypeScript browser UI\nVite in development\nproduction host not configured" as browser
cloud "AWS Region (target)" {
  node "VPC across 2+ AZs" {
    node "Public subnets" {
      component "Application Load Balancer\nACM TLS termination\nHTTP redirects to HTTPS" as alb
    }
    node "Private application subnets\nNo public task IPs" {
      component "ECS Fargate service\nSpring Boot Workhub\nnon-root container" as ecs
      component "Weekly reminder Lambda\nVPC attached" as reminder
    }
    node "Private database subnets" {
      database "RDS PostgreSQL\nproposed MVP database\nnot supported by current build" as db
    }
    component "S3 gateway endpoint" as s3ep
    component "Interface endpoints\nECR / Logs / Secrets Manager" as endpoints
  }
  cloud "Private S3 bucket\nBlock Public Access\nSSE-KMS / TLS only" as s3 {
    folder "evidence/*" as evidence
    folder "attendance-selfies/*" as selfies
  }
  component "CloudWatch Logs\nfinite retention, encrypted" as logs
  component "CloudWatch alarms\nECS / ALB / DB health" as alarms
  component "CloudWatch Lambda logs" as lambdalogs
  component "EventBridge Scheduler\nweekly schedule (proposed)" as scheduler
  component "Scheduler delivery DLQ\n(proposed)" as schedulerdlq
  component "Lambda processing DLQ\n(proposed)" as lambdadlq
  component "ECR\napproved image" as ecr
  component "Secrets Manager\nDB credentials" as secrets
  component "IAM task execution role\nimage pull, logs, secret read" as execrole
  component "IAM application task role\nobject prefixes only" as taskrole
  component "IAM Lambda execution role\nlogs, secret, VPC ENI" as lambdarole
  component "EventBridge invoke role\nInvokeFunction only" as invokerole
  component "ACM certificate" as acm
}

user --> browser : browser session
browser --> alb : HTTPS /api
alb --> ecs : port 8080\nALB SG -> task SG only
ecs --> db : TLS PostgreSQL 5432\ntask SG -> DB SG only
reminder --> db : TLS PostgreSQL 5432\nnotification/progress queries
ecs --> s3ep : HTTPS S3 requests
s3ep --> s3 : private object API
ecs --> s3 : authenticated S3 object API\ntask role + scoped prefixes
ecs --> endpoints : HTTPS 443
endpoints --> ecr : image pull
endpoints --> logs : stdout/stderr
endpoints --> secrets : task secret retrieval
logs --> alarms : metric filters / alarms
lambdalogs --> alarms : invocation errors / duration
scheduler --> reminder : scheduled event
scheduler --> schedulerdlq : target delivery retries exhausted
reminder --> lambdadlq : async processing retries exhausted
reminder --> lambdalogs : sanitized run summary
execrole ..> ecs : assumed by ECS agent
taskrole ..> ecs : assumed by application
lambdarole ..> reminder : Lambda execution
invokerole ..> scheduler : invokes reminder only
acm ..> alb : TLS certificate

note bottom of ecs
CURRENT CODE BOUNDARY
SQLite local profile only. PostgreSQL support needs implementation.
Browser upload bytes go through the API and storage adapter;
S3 task-role access is not verified against AWS.
Lambda handler and ZIP packaging are implemented and locally tested,
but a supported persistent database is needed before AWS invocation.
AWS resources and EventBridge schedule have not been deployed or tested.
end note

note bottom of browser
Frontend tests and production build pass.
No manual browser/E2E acceptance has been recorded.
The Spring Boot Docker image does not package the frontend.
end note

note bottom of s3
No public ACLs or public bucket policy.
Distinct evidence and selfie prefixes.
Retention schedule requires data-owner approval.
end note

note bottom of logs
Never send selfie bytes, coordinates, geofence distance,
credentials, request bodies, or signed URLs to logs.
end note
@enduml
